+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch and returns a new JSON value.
+Object members whose patch values are `null` are removed; other object members are merged recursively.
+A non-object patch replaces the complete target. Neither input is mutated.
